So eyes and a brain are not sufficient conditions for seeing (sleep, etc, and 
the blind man show that).  But even necessary is questionable, since many 
brainless critters see at least light and dark -- and may be eyeless, too.  But 
it does work for humans and most other critters we have a lot of daily contact 
with.





